WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.954
It was a rainy day.

2
00:00:13.955 --> 00:00:18.382
Rover wanted to go outside.

3
00:00:18.383 --> 00:00:21.320
"No, Rover," said Emmy.

4
00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:26.229
"We have to play inside today."

5
00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:29.913
Rover followed Emmy into the kitchen.

6
00:00:29.914 --> 00:00:35.925
Oliver and Harry were eating lunch.

7
00:00:35.926 --> 00:00:39.778
"Let's make banana bread," Emmy said.

8
00:00:39.779 --> 00:00:44.435
"Yeah!" said the boys.

9
00:00:44.436 --> 00:00:47.965
Emmy beat the eggs.

10
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:53.476
Harry mashed the bananas.

11
00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:56.772
Oliver got out the flour.

12
00:00:56.773 --> 00:00:59.552
Rover tried to help.

13
00:00:59.553 --> 00:01:15.409
But he got covered in flour!

14
00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:20.444
"Now let's paint something," Emmy said.

15
00:01:20.445 --> 00:01:26.817
She got out paper and paints.

16
00:01:26.818 --> 00:01:30.039
Oliver painted a pirate ship.

17
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.054
Emmy painted some flowers.

18
00:01:33.055 --> 00:01:36.638
Harry painted a baseball player.

19
00:01:36.639 --> 00:01:39.399
Rover tried to help.

20
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:43.634
But he got covered in paint!

21
00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:48.257
"I think Rover is bored," said Oliver.

22
00:01:48.258 --> 00:01:50.813
Emmy nodded.

23
00:01:50.814 --> 00:01:54.065
"I know what to do next," she said.

24
00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:58.535
"Let's give Rover a bath."

25
00:01:58.536 --> 00:02:03.734
Emmy filled the tub with water.

26
00:02:03.735 --> 00:02:08.748
Oliver put soap in the water.

27
00:02:08.749 --> 00:02:14.211
Harry put Rover in the water.

28
00:02:14.212 --> 00:02:17.428
But Rover didn't like the tub.

29
00:02:17.429 --> 00:02:22.503
Water splashed. Soap sprayed.

30
00:02:22.504 --> 00:02:31.043
Rover slipped and slid!

31
00:02:31.044 --> 00:02:35.099
Finally Emmy opened the back door.

32
00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:39.629
"Go, Rover!" she said.

33
00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:43.754
Rover ran out into the rain.

34
00:02:43.755 --> 00:02:48.195
"Now Rover is having fun," said Emmy.

35
00:02:48.196 --> 00:02:56.480
"And he's getting a bath!" said Oliver.
